# Types of Memory

## Primary Memory

- RAM
- ROM
- Cache Memory

### RAM

- Volatile Memory
- Temporary Storage
- Fast Access

### ROM

- Non-Volatile
- Permanent Storage
- Stores Boot Program

### Cache Memory

- Extremely Fast
- Located Near CPU
- Improves Performance

---

## Secondary Memory

Examples:

- HDD
- SSD
